Feature: Populated derived aggregate owners
  Scenario: zero-based rational weights
    Given actual rational curves and square or non-square rational surfaces
    Then released functions inspect first and late zero or negative weights
    And real derived arrays keep their zero lower bounds
  Scenario: actual segment continuity
    Given typed LineIndex and ArcIndex segments in source order
    Then each endpoint must equal the following start index
  Scenario: exact material layer sums
    Given real layer-set references with exact binary-fraction thicknesses
    Then total thickness retains the declared order and exact sum
  Scenario: deliberate negative population
    Given explicitly invalid weights and discontinuous segments
    Then full issued validation retains each false rule and invalid result
